344
00:44:46.090 --> 00:45:00.969
Chris - Base: you know, more extensible and don't require kind of continuously updating things. But I think there's a place for them, like, I kind of lean… I was… it's more of, you know, a direction of leaning, like, ideally no new opcodes, but, like, I think there is times where, you want them.

